@url = http://localhost:8104

### Agent Card - manifest agenta A2A
GET {{url}}/.well-known/agent-card.json

### A2A - eskalacja ticketu
POST {{url}}/a2a
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": "test-1",
  "method": "message/send",
  "params": {
    "message": {
      "role": "user",
      "parts": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Eskaluj ticket abc-123"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
